WEBVTT

00:03.960 --> 00:05.200
All right, so now for the city.

00:05.240 --> 00:06.880
We don't have only one city.

00:06.920 --> 00:08.800
We have different types of cities.

00:08.840 --> 00:11.200
So mainly there are like two types of CTE.

00:11.400 --> 00:15.440
We have the non-recursive CTE and recursive CTE.

00:15.560 --> 00:20.280
And we can say for the non-recursive CTE we have two subtypes.

00:20.280 --> 00:25.440
The first type is the standalone city and the second one is the nested CTE.

00:25.480 --> 00:28.320
And now what we're going to do we're going to deep dive into each type.

00:28.480 --> 00:32.920
And we will start with the easiest form of the CTE, the standalone CTE.

00:33.520 --> 00:35.200
It is the simplest form.
